    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A substantial seven-bedroom detached property set on approximately c0.55 hectares (c.1.36 acres) at Cappanargid, Rathangan. Offering generous accommodation together with an impressive site, this property presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a spacious family home with considerable potential.\n\nThe property benefits from a large rear garden, providing extensive outdoor space together with excellent scope for landscaping, recreation, gardening or simply enjoying the privacy and tranquillity of the surrounding countryside.\n\nInternally, the accommodation offers seven bedrooms, providing flexibility for a large family, home-working requirements or a variety of alternative uses, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The generous site and detached nature of the property further enhance its appeal.\n\nThe property does require renovation and upgrading works internally and externally, offering prospective purchasers the opportunity to modernise and refurbish the house to their own requirements and create a home tailored to their individual taste and lifestyle.\n\nSet in a peaceful rural location at Cappanargid, while remaining within reach of the amenities and services of Rathangan and the surrounding area, this property is likely to appeal to buyers looking for space, privacy and the opportunity to put their own stamp on a substantial detached residence. An attractive opportunity for purchasers seeking a substantial property on a generous site, with significant potential for refurbishment and enhancement. \n\nViewing comes highly recommended strictly by prior appointment with Agent only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Wooden flooring\n\nKitchen: Wooden flooring, fully fitted kitchen units, stainless steel sink, stove fireplace, doorway access to dining room, back door access to rear garden \n\nDining Room: Carpet flooring \n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, feature red brick fireplace\n\nBedroom 1 (Downstairs): Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 2: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 3: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 4: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 5: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 6: Wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 7: Wooden flooring\n\nBathroom (Downstairs): Tiled flooring, bath, WHB \n\nFeatures:\n\nPVC front door\nPVC double glazed windows\nAttic access via landing \nNot overlooked\nOil fired central heating\nPrivate well\nPrivate septic tank\nBuilt in 1994\nc.257.179sqmt \n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
